  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NESA Center Silk Road Future Leaders Seminar 01-25 Strategic Leadership for National Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This seminar is intended for young national security professionals with less than 10 years of experience who will be the future leaders of the countries in Central and South Asia. Through engagement with distinguished scholars and experienced practitioners, participants 1) broaden their understanding of timely security issues, 2) learn about U.S. policy, and 3) develop a professional network of regional partners. This iteration will focus on the implications of strategic competition for regional security. In addition to academic sessions, the seminar theme will be explored through a variety of group case studies and/or local field study visits.</narrative>
  </description>
